# tighConaillClothes -- Conall, after the curtain: the clothes, the stew, the training grounds
#
# IRISH IS A FIRST DRAFT -- check before shipping.

@file skye/tighConaill
@encounter 1


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
= node 0 — the clothes, the stew
@continue
Your clothes are washed and dried, there on the chest.
% Tá do chuid éadaí nite agus triomaithe, ansin ar an gcófra.
Help yourself to the stew, and rest as long as you like.
% Ith leat den stobhach, agus lig do scíth chomh fada agus is mian leat.

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
= node 1 — the training grounds
When you are ready, come and find me in the training grounds.
% Nuair a bheidh tú réidh, tar agus aimsigh mé ar an bhfaiche.
The others are up at the castle. We will have the place to ourselves.
% Tá na daoine eile thuas ag an gcaisleán. Beidh an áit againn dúinn féin.
